        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Neetho, Sachein\n- People: John Mahendran, Prakash Kovelamudi, Mahek Chahal, Kalaipuli S. Dhanu, Devi Sri Prasad\n- Roles: director, actor, producer, composer, actress, model\n\nFacts:\n- Neetho is a 2002 Telugu romance film directed by John Mahendran.\n- Neetho stars Prakash Kovelamudi and Mahek Chahal in their debut roles.\n- Mahek Chahal was born on 1 February 1979.\n- Mahek Chahal is a Norwegian actress and model who appears in Bollywood films.\n- Sachein is based on John Mahendran's earlier Telugu film Neetho.\n- Sachein was produced by Kalaipuli S. Dhanu.\n- Sachein has its score and soundtrack composed by Devi Sri Prasad.",
